\f0\b \cf2 \strokec2 Importance:
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\li375\fi-9\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 A foundational understanding of motor constants (Kt), open-loop characteristics (Speed-Torque curves), and different motor topologies (PM vs. Wound-Field) is essential for selecting, sizing, and operating electric drives. Developing robust position control and understanding the need for features like anti-windup are core skills in mechatronics and control engineering, directly impacting system precision and stability.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
