\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 \strokec2 Market Relevance:
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx409\pardeftab720\li422\fi-15\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Fundamental to precise motion systems across all industries. Position control is critical for robotics, CNC machinery, factory automation, and hard disk drives. Anti-windup implementation is standard practice in all commercial controllers (PLCs, servo drives) to ensure systems react predictably and avoid stability issues following large command changes or motor saturation.}